{"id":4224,"mal_id":4224,"title":"Toradora!","englishTitle":"Toradora!","title_english":"Toradora!","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Tiger X Dragon"],"en":"Toradora!","ja":"とらドラ！"},"synopsis":"Ryuuji Takasu is a gentle high school student with a love for housework; but in contrast to his kind nature, he has an intimidating face that often gets him labeled as a delinquent. On the other hand is Taiga Aisaka, a small, doll-like student, who is anything but a cute and fragile girl. Equipped with a wooden katana and feisty personality, Taiga is known throughout the school as the \"Palmtop Tiger.\"\n\nOne day, an embarrassing mistake causes the two students to cross paths. Ryuuji discovers that Taiga actually has a sweet side: she has a crush on the popular vice president, Yuusaku Kitamura, who happens to be his best friend. But things only get crazier when Ryuuji reveals that he has a crush on Minori Kushieda—Taiga's best friend!\n\nToradora! is a romantic comedy that follows this odd duo as they embark on a quest to help each other with their respective crushes, forming an unlikely alliance in the process.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Ryuuji Takasu es un amable estudiante de secundaria al que le encantan las tareas del hogar; pero en contraste con su naturaleza amable, tiene un rostro intimidante que a menudo hace que lo etiqueten como delincuente. Por otro lado está Taiga Aisaka, una pequeña estudiante parecida a una muñeca, que es todo menos una niña linda y frágil. Equipada con una katana de madera y una personalidad luchadora, Taiga es conocida en toda la escuela como el \"Tigre de bolsillo\".\n\nUn día, un error vergonzoso hace que los dos estudiantes se crucen. Ryuuji descubre que Taiga en realidad tiene un lado dulce: está enamorada del popular vicepresidente, Yuusaku Kitamura, quien resulta ser su mejor amigo. Pero las cosas se vuelven más locas cuando Ryuuji revela que está enamorado de Minori Kushieda, ¡la mejor amiga de Taiga!\n\n¡Toradora! es una comedia romántica que sigue a este extraño dúo mientras se embarcan en una búsqueda para ayudarse mutuamente con sus respectivos amores, formando una alianza improbable en el proceso.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1415,"average_episode_duration":1415,"startDate":"2008-10-02","start_date":"2008-10-02","endDate":"2009-03-26","end_date":"2009-03-26","season":"fall","year":2008,"start_season":{"year":2008,"season":"fall"},"episodes":25,"num_episodes":25,"score":8.03,"mean":8.03,"numListUsers":2404287,"num_list_users":2404287,"genres":[{"id":8,"name":"Drama"},{"id":64,"name":"Love Polygon"},{"id":22,"name":"Romance"},{"id":23,"name":"School"}],"studios":[{"id":7,"name":"J.C.Staff"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/82hAXKATyuldbt4PxSNnHHy2BVO.jpg","logo_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7LMMn3qftfi6aH5bfqjlqmYPWgo.png","tmdb_id":"42916","tmdb_updated_at":"2026-11-21T22:33:38.707Z","images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/13/22128.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/13/22128l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/13/22128.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/13/22128l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/13/22128l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"thursday","time":"01:20","day_of_the_week":"thursday","start_time":"01:20","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"thursday 01:20"},"rank":733,"popularity":26,"rating":"pg_13","num_scoring_users":1491140,"nsfw":"white","source":"light_novel","background":"Toradora! was selected as a recommended work by the awards jury of the 13th Japan Media Arts Festival in 2009.\n\nThe light novel was also adapted into a video game for PlayStation Portable, released only in Japan and published by Namco Bandai Games in 2009.\n","related_anime":[{"node":{"id":6127,